# BUG-1: Schoof's CRT/BSGS finisher span on small p: M > Hasse width, so
# M P = O for every P and the giant-step loop never found a candidate.
ecorder [0,0,0,0,1] mod 5 using schoof
ecorder [0,0,0,0,1] mod 7 using schoof
ecorder [0,0,0,2,1] mod 5 using schoof
# controls: the naive counts and Schoof on larger curves agree
ecorder [0,0,0,0,1] mod 5
ecorder [0,0,0,0,1] mod 7
ecorder [0,0,0,2,1] mod 11 using schoof
ecorder [0,0,0,2,1] mod 97 using schoof
ecpoints [0,0,0,0,1] mod 5
ecpoints [0,0,0,0,1] mod 7
